"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeEdit" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` make all file edits in `project` without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeShell" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` run commands matching `patterns` in `project` without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeShellRelated" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` run commands matching `patterns` (and the commands nested in this one) in `project` without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeExternal" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` access files in `dir` (or in the repository that contains it) without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeGeneric" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` do this kind of thing in `project` without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeScript" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` use the tool that it asks about here (the script may use `tools`) in `project` without asking again, also in other scripts. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeScriptMore" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` use the tool that it asks about here (the script may use `tools` and other tools) in `project` without asking again, also in other scripts. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
"ACPPermissionAlwaysScopeTool" -> "\"Always allow\" lets `agent` use `tool` in `project` without asking again. `agent` saves this choice, so it also applies to future sessions.",
